    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34067" root="فضح" body-key="f">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَفْضَحُ</span></b>  <i>White, but not intensely so:</i> (S, L, K:)
see also explanations of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فُضْحَةٌ</span>, indicating other
meanings: fem. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَضْحَآءُ</span>. (L, TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Hence,
because of their colours, (S,) <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الأَفْضَحُ</span> signifies
<i>The lion:</i> and <i>The camel.</i> (S, K.)

